ry\">As of Oct 12, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 48% of normal in September to October and 50% in October to November. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 188% of normal on the middle. Grid 11858 had its driest year in 1962, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
